Package: worldwide-ai-shell
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Worldwide Vapor
Depends: worldwide-ai-os-base, apparmor, libgtk-3-0t64, libnss3, libgbm1, libasound2t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0t64, libcups2t64, libdrm2, libxkbcommon0, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, xdg-utils
Description: Worldwide AI OS: the window the workspace opens in
 A sandboxed Electron window that shows the Worldwide AI workspace and
 nothing else. The page gets no access to the computer and no
 permissions; links outside the workspace open in the normal browser.
 It opens at sign-in and from the applications list. It contains no
 account, password, key or token.
